{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":24955361,"ns":0,"title":"High-tensile chain","extract":"A high-tensile chain, also referred to as a transport chain, is a link chain with a high tensile strength  used for drawing or securing loads. This type of chain usually consist of broad (thick/heavy) metal, oblong torus-shaped links for high strength.","description":"Chain used for drawing or securing loads","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}